        "content": "## 🔵 TRIGGER LAYER\n**Node:** TRIGGER_Webhook\n\nAccepts POST requests to `/webhook/lead-capture`\n\n**Expected fields:**\n- full_name, email, phone\n- company_name, lead_source\n- service_interest, message, timestamp\n\n⚠️ Update webhook path slug if needed.\n\nProduction URL: http://localhost:5678/webhook/lead-capture  this is the endpoint your forms/apps will POST to",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 320,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "b7a4b370-7212-492f-82ae-9220709a23ef",
      "name": "NOTE_TriggerLayer",
