    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🟡 VALIDATION LAYER\n**Nodes:** VALIDATE_Input → ROUTE_Validation\n\nChecks:\n✅ Email field exists\n✅ Email format is valid (regex)\n✅ Phone field exists\n\nSets `isValid` (bool) and `validationReason` on each record.\n\n**Routing:**\n- IF true → CLEAN_Data\n- IF false → STORE_InvalidLeads",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 340,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "b5b6500a-7f90-46de-8802-073618517e51",
      "name": "NOTE_ValidationLayer",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        560,
        64
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const data = $input.first().json;\n\nconst email = String(data.email || '').trim();\nconst phone = String(data.phone || '').trim();\nconst emailRegex = /^[^\\s@]+@[^\\s@]+\\.[^\\s@]+$/;\n\nlet isValid = true;\nconst reasons = [];\n\nif (!email) {\n  isValid = false;\n  reasons.push('Email is missing');\n} else if (!emailRegex.test(email)) {\n  isValid = false;\n  reasons.push('Email format is invalid');\n}\n\nif (!phone) {\n  isValid = false;\n  reasons.push('Phone number is missing');\n}\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    ...data,\n    isValid,\n    validationReason: reasons.length > 0 ? reasons.join('; ') : 'Valid'\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "id": "a0f31eda-2535-41df-b886-276e9984ebee",
      "name": "VALIDATE_Input",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        560,
        352
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "boolean": [
            {
              "value1": "={{ $json.isValid }}",
              "value2": true
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "d0567d4e-7468-4720-89bd-0d47988066a6",
      "name": "ROUTE_Validation",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        816,
        352
      ]
    },
    {
