    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🟢 DATA CLEANING LAYER\n**Node:** CLEAN_Data\n\nOperations:\n- Trim leading/trailing whitespace from all text fields\n- Convert email to lowercase\n- Standardize phone: 10-digit → XXX-XXX-XXXX\n- Collapse duplicate internal spaces\n- Strip unsafe special characters from text fields",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 320,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "7fd9bf47-d5c0-47fc-8173-0c7d577f4b49",
      "name": "NOTE_CleaningLayer",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        976,
        64
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const data = $input.first().json;\n\nconst cleanText = (val) => {\n  if (typeof val !== 'string') return String(val || '');\n  return val\n    .trim()\n    .replace(/\\s+/g, ' ')\n    .replace(/[^\\w\\s@.,\\-'&#()/]/g, '');\n};\n\nconst standardizePhone = (phone) => {\n  if (!phone) return '';\n  const raw = String(phone);\n  const digits = raw.replace(/\\D/g, '');\n  if (digits.length === 10) {\n    return `${digits.slice(0, 3)}-${digits.slice(3, 6)}-${digits.slice(6)}`;\n  } else if (digits.length === 11 && digits.startsWith('1')) {\n    return `+1-${digits.slice(1, 4)}-${digits.slice(4, 7)}-${digits.slice(7)}`;\n  }\n  return raw.trim();\n};\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    ...data,\n    full_name: cleanText(data.full_name),\n    email: String(data.email || '').toLowerCase().trim(),\n    phone: standardizePhone(data.phone),\n    company_name: cleanText(data.company_name),\n    lead_source: cleanText(data.lead_source),\n    service_interest: cleanText(data.service_interest),\n    message: cleanText(data.message)\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "id": "95208676-670b-439d-bea8-42f0e55607b8",
      "name": "CLEAN_Data",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1088,
        336
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🔵 PROCESSING LAYER\n**Node:** PROCESS_GenerateLeadID\n\nGenerates unique Lead ID:\n`LEAD-YYYYMMDD-RAND4`\nExample: `LEAD-20240515-4823`\n\nAdds fields:\n- `leadId` — unique identifier\n- `created_date` — ISO 8601 timestamp\n- `status` — set to 'New'",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 320,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "71994223-d482-411d-a426-f279542133f7",
      "name": "NOTE_ProcessingLayer",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1360,
        64
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const data = $input.first().json;\n\nconst now = new Date();\nconst year = now.getFullYear();\nconst month = String(now.getMonth() + 1).padStart(2, '0');\nconst day = String(now.getDate()).padStart(2, '0');\nconst dateStr = `${year}${month}${day}`;\nconst rand = Math.floor(1000 + Math.random() * 9000);\nconst leadId = `LEAD-${dateStr}-${rand}`;\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    ...data,\n    leadId,\n    created_date: now.toISOString(),\n    status: 'New'\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "id": "26c8725a-f135-4196-acf0-bcb8ed687650",
      "name": "PROCESS_GenerateLeadID",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1376,
        336
      ]
    },
